            <title>[IGNITE-13868] Add additional tests related to simultaneously created caches in the same non-existing cache group</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13868</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It looks like the fix proposed by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12255&quot; title=&quot;Cache affinity fetching and calculation on client nodes may be broken in some cases&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-12255&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-12255&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; should be additionally tested (for instance, cache creation and destruction from servers and clients: thin, thick, jdbc, and rest).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
